  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "測量平差",
    "sub_ename": "SURVEY ADJUSTMENTS",
    "describe_ch": "目前測量儀器及方法日新月異，測量數量十分龐大，至於數據資料該如何計算且處理前該如何偵錯，如何以數學統計方法及利用電腦運算能力，達到自動化處理的目的，本課程教學目標則是在已有的測量基礎上，建立同學完整的資料偵錯及處理計算的能力，並藉此加強瞭解統計學的應用。",
    "describe_eh": "Recently the methods and instrument of surveying are improved a lot, and the data become more and more.  Regarding how to deal with the amount of data and data-snooping is one of very important issues.  The subjective of the course is to get familiar with the basic mathematics and how to perform software available in order to do data processing and get optimal solution.  In addition, another purpose is to understand and apply statistical method.",
    "pre_subname": "LAND2022測量學",
    "pre_sub_id3": "LAND2022",
    "pre_sub_ename": "LAND2022 SURVEYING",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "了解測量誤差理論及統計平差的原理",
      "describe_en": "To understand error theory and statistical adjustment"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "具備最小平差優化解的推演能力及熟悉誤差傳播定律",
      "describe_en": "To familiar with the derivation of least-squares adjustment and error propagation."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "具備測量數據處理及偵錯的能力，與坐標計算的方法。",
      "describe_en": "To be able to do data processing and data snooping and coordinates calculation."
    }
  ],
